 },
 "summary": "Seven single-phase full-wave bridges of four glass-passivated diodes in the in-line four-lead through-hole GBU case, alike except for reverse voltage, from 50 V (GBU8A) to 1000 V (GBU8M). Each delivers 8.0 A average with the case on a heatsink at 60 °C, or 3.9 A on a PCB at 40 °C ambient, and takes a 200 A half-sine surge. Forward drop is at most 1.0 V per diode at 8.0 A. The case insulation withstands 1500 VRMS and the part is UL recognised (file E54214).",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Repetitive peak reverse voltage VRRM",
